# PUDO Optimize Rule

Before finishing:

- Self-review correctness, maintainability, security, performance, and documentation impact.
- Confirm changes satisfy the success criteria.
- Run relevant checks or explain skipped checks.
- Verify no unrelated files, tests, or public contracts were changed.
- Document residual risks and follow-up only when useful.
- Apply Release Gate criteria for merge, deploy, or handoff.

Use `quality/review` documents when available; otherwise use `quality/qc-checklists.md`.
